<title>SWEDEN: ABB sees higher sales H2 1997 than H1.</title>
<headline>ABB sees higher sales H2 1997 than H1.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss/Swedish engineering group ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG chief executive Goran Lindahl said on Friday he expected sales to increase in the second quarter of the year compared to the first.</p>
</text>
